{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase includes: a sandbox simulator focused on physics and magic simulation, featuring a built\u2011in character editor and a lightweight video editing tool; plus a playable, developer\u2011crafted adventure\u2011puzzle RPG level created with the simulator. <br>Edit almost anything in 2D\u2014scenes, items, spells, physics, and characters. Create your own CG cinematics and stories, and bring nearly any 2D idea to life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/8821c04c442fc5b3f5390a11f612075e.poster.avif?t=1760495850\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/8821c04c442fc5b3f5390a11f612075e.webm?t=1760495850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/8821c04c442fc5b3f5390a11f612075e.mp4?t=1760495850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover countless hidden magic and ideas. Adventure, puzzles, story\u2014even virtual cricket duels\u2014it's all up to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/cd94614a18ee514fbcfbdd05f8898c1e.poster.avif?t=1760495850\" width=436 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/cd94614a18ee514fbcfbdd05f8898c1e.webm?t=1760495850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/cd94614a18ee514fbcfbdd05f8898c1e.mp4?t=1760495850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comes with a rich motion library plus built-in video recording and export\u2014you can even make 2D animated films right in the editor.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979170?t=1760495850","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979170?t=1760495850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/86f804825d5af945d3b08cc35e5edb49b0c05bb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760495850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/86f804825d5af945d3b08cc35e5edb49b0c05bb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760495850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase includes: a sandbox simulator focused on physics and magic simulation, featuring a built\u2011in character editor and a lightweight video editing tool; plus a playable, developer\u2011crafted adventure\u2011puzzle RPG level created with the simulator. <br>Edit almost anything in 2D\u2014scenes, items, spells, physics, and characters. Create your own CG cinematics and stories, and bring nearly any 2D idea to life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/8821c04c442fc5b3f5390a11f612075e.poster.avif?t=1760495850\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/8821c04c442fc5b3f5390a11f612075e.webm?t=1760495850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/8821c04c442fc5b3f5390a11f612075e.mp4?t=1760495850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover countless hidden magic and ideas. Adventure, puzzles, story\u2014even virtual cricket duels\u2014it's all up to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/cd94614a18ee514fbcfbdd05f8898c1e.poster.avif?t=1760495850\" width=436 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/cd94614a18ee514fbcfbdd05f8898c1e.webm?t=1760495850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/extras/cd94614a18ee514fbcfbdd05f8898c1e.mp4?t=1760495850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comes with a rich motion library plus built-in video recording and export\u2014you can even make 2D animated films right in the editor.</p>","developers":["FunHeartDreamMaker"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979170/4bce6c471cad0e3abe15d2543ca9087ddf99d7e9/header.jpg?t=1760495850","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> \u82f9\u679c M1 \u6216\u82f1\u7279\u5c14\u9177\u777f M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> \u82f9\u679c M1 \u6216\u82f1\u7279\u5c14\u9177\u777f M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3979170/1966661906/949e1f5147e61ff749da60e9d3ac0bc425a43ac4/1758855214/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759543944","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3979170/1966661906/949e1f5147e61ff749da60e9d3ac0bc425a43ac4/1758855214/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759543944","highli